	<entry name="FactionX/BlastDamage" value="Improved Frag Casings"/>
	<entry name="FactionX/BlastDamageDescription" value="Increases the armour penetration."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/BlastDamageFlavor" value="By using a more advanced engraving protocol on the casing, the lethality of explosive is much improved."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/BoltDamage" value="Kraken Bolts"/>
	<entry name="FactionX/BoltDamageDescription" value="Increases the armour penetration."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/BoltDamageFlavor" value="An Astartes-derived upgrade to the standard bolter, this kit allows a bolter to fire Kraken penetrator rounds, hard-tipped projectiles with a heavier explosive charge. These heavier rounds are much favoured by the Space Marine Deathwatch alien hunters."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/CityTier2" value="Substructure Extension"/>
	<entry name="FactionX/CityTier2Description" value="Increases the tile acquisition radius."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/CityTier2Flavor" value="One day, this will be a Hive City—a billion people in one structure, towering over a poisoned world—but first, this settlement needs to expand a little, to set the foundations for the galaxies' biggest conurbations."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/CityTier3" value="Substructure Supply Tunnels"/>
	<entry name="FactionX/CityTier3Description" value="Increases the tile acquisition radius."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/CityTier3Flavor" value="The Departmento Munitorum might be inefficient, but they can plan and the Techpriest Explorators and Servitors can build. These bunkered tunnels allow the Astra Militarum commander to oversee a much larger city area, without losing defensive control."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/ShootSharpAndScarper" value="Shoot Sharp and Scarper"/>
	<entry name="FactionX/ShootSharpAndScarperDescription" value="Actions do not consume movement."/>
	<entry name="FactionX/ShootSharpAndScarperFlavor" value="What Ratlings lack militarily in, well, everything, they make up in knowing when it’s the right time to shoot and when it’s the right time to run."/>
